Package: m6Aswitch
Title: Integrating Isoform Switching with m6A Methylation Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tarun", "Chikatipalli", , "tarunchikatipalli6@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: m6Aswitch integrates isoform-level switching analysis with m6A 
    methylation site-level quantification to identify functional rewiring of m6A 
    regulation across isoform switches. It bridges m6AnetAnalyzer output and 
    IsoformSwitchAnalyzeR results to detect which m6A sites are gained, lost, or 
    retained during isoform switches. Supports dual-threshold analysis: high-confidence 
    (probability ≥ 0.9) for primary results and sensitivity analysis (probability ≥ 0.5) 
    for supplementary studies. Includes DRACH motif validation, genomic coordinate 
    lifting, and comprehensive visualization tools.
